        ⛔ READ THE RATIO COLUMN, NOT THE ABSOLUTE NUMBERS. The ns/op figures
          are one machine on one day and mean nothing elsewhere; the ratio
          between two binaries measured back to back on the same machine is
          the part that carries.
        
        ⚠ THIS DOES NOT MAKE musl A BAD LIBC. It is smaller and starts faster,
          measured in experiments/40- and 60-, and those are real advantages
          for short-lived processes. The two sets of measurements are about
          different things and neither cancels the other.
        
